!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/fixtures/validate-core-identity.tn"
!!meta:"https://tson.io/2026/38/m/meta.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/2026/38/m/core.tn"
@doc:"""
  A catalogue of schema documents named by core's `identity`, [TSON-DATA] §2.2.1's canonical identity as a value: one
  string-class type, so no value needs a tag. Every reference naming one identity is one value, so a set of
  identities holds a document once and a map keyed by identity holds it under one key, however each reference
  spells it.
  """
{
  identities => set<identity>
  catalogue => {
    home:     identity
    schemas?: identities
    titles?:  { identity => text }
  }
}
